1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 17=

2
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:07,160
Your Highness.

3
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:09,360
The assassins sent
to Langjing Kingdom have sent word.

4
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:09,840
They said

5
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,400
Hetao has been taken away.

6
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,040
I want her found alive,

7
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:15,160
or her body if she's dead.

8
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:18,320
Keep a close watch
on the docks and ferry crossings.

9
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,000
Yes.

10
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:21,560
The Second Prince requests an audience.

11
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,520
You may leave.

12
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:36,960
Greetings, Mother.

13
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:37,880
These

14
00:01:37,960 --> 00:01:39,840
are all
rare medicinal herbs I had my men find.

15
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,890
I hope
they will help Father recover soon.

16
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:42,920
(Putao?)

17
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:46,260
You've gone to a lot of trouble, Piao.

18
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,920
Then I shall leave you to rest, Mother.

19
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:53,520
(She...)

20
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:55,720
(How did she become the Empress?)

21
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:02,960
Has something happened?

22
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,240
I'm afraid Zhou already knows

23
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,240
about what happened at Xichun Pavilion.

24
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,520
So what if he does?

25
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:14,280
If word of this gets out,

26
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,480
the entire Bojue Kingdom

27
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:17,000
will be plunged into endless turmoil.

28
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:20,280
There's only
one way to resolve this now.

29
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,120
What is it?

30
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,360
Strike first.

31
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,080
Miss Hetao,

32
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,160
who exactly is she?

33
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,280
Her name is Putao.

34
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,160
She was one of the girls

35
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:35,840
sold into Xichun Pavilion with me.

36
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,160
In a pleasure house,

37
00:02:38,180 --> 00:02:40,270
- No matter what the customers wanted,
- Can you dance?

38
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,660
we had no choice but to endure it.

39
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:43,760
You can't even dance.

40
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,160
What about drinking?

41
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:45,800
I can.

42
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,080
- I can.
- Bring the wine.

43
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:00,000
Drink it yourself.

44
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:04,880
Who said you could use a cup?

45
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:05,990
Drink straight from the jug.

46
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,360
You're all here selling yourself.

47
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,360
Who are you pretending to be?

48
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,360
But Putao

49
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:18,080
always protected me.

50
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,600
Drink!

51
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,160
Sir.

52
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:25,520
Look, here at Xichun Pavilion,

53
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:27,080
she's not the only girl.

54
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,800
You've got me too.

55
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,560
I can dance.

56
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,360
- I'll dance for you, sir.
- Good.

57
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:32,880
Go on, then.

58
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:38,960
Sir.

59
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:39,760
You know what?

60
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:40,640
Here at Xichun Pavilion,

61
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:41,880
we have a little dog.

62
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,280
Whenever it sees a customer,

63
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:43,960
it does this.

64
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,600
It rubs and rubs against them.

65
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,760
That's where I learned it.

66
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,280
Do you like it, sir?

67
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:52,760
I like little dogs like you.

68
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:54,800
Bring the wine.

69
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:56,920
Sir,

70
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:58,640
let me give you a drink.

71
00:03:58,640 --> 00:03:59,320
All right.

72
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,880
Drink up.

73
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,560
Sir.

74
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,040
Quick.

75
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,520
Let me wipe that for you.

76
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,040
There.

77
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,160
From that moment on,

78
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:09,960
I knew

79
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,760
she didn't belong in Xichun Pavilion.

80
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,360
One day,

81
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,200
she would leave that place.

82
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,640
Women like us

83
00:04:18,660 --> 00:04:20,150
are destined to spend our whole lives

84
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,760
waiting for men to give us handouts,

85
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:23,200
waiting for their pity.

86
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:26,560
When they're
in a good mood, they give us something,

87
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,040
and we have to smile happily.

88
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:29,600
When they're in a bad mood

89
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,160
and take it out on us,

90
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:33,200
we have to smile even brighter.

91
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:34,400
At least

92
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,440
I have enough to eat now.

93
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:38,760
I don't care.

94
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:40,480
As long as I can survive.

95
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:43,680
Are we women

96
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,840
only meant to live like this?

97
00:04:48,780 --> 00:04:50,680
A golden carp
was never meant to stay in a pond.

98
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,480
One day, you'll leave this place.

99
00:04:58,360 --> 00:05:00,240
Putao treated me like a sister.

100
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:03,240
So I'd do anything for her.

101
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:16,000
- Fire!
- Fire!

102
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:17,840
- Fire!
- Fire!

103
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:19,440
The day Xichun Pavilion caught fire,

104
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:21,560
I ran a long way with her.

105
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,760
She wanted me to leave with her.

106
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:24,560
But

107
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:27,560
Go!

108
00:05:27,580 --> 00:05:28,640
If we leave, we leave together.

109
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:29,240
Putao,

110
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:30,320
I belong here.

111
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:31,320
You're different from me.

112
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,160
You're a phoenix.

113
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,680
One day, you'll soar even farther.

114
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,360
Go.

115
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,280
Hurry!

116
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:41,960
All I know is

117
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:43,520
she left Langjing Kingdom.

118
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,880
For more than twenty years after that,

119
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:50,480
I never heard anything about her again.

120
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:52,000
I never imagined

121
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,440
she would truly rise to such heights

122
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,600
and become the Empress of this realm.

123
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:58,640
Some time ago,

124
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,520
I heard from the servants

125
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,200
that you went to

126
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:04,320
a pleasure house called Xichun Pavilion.

127
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:06,080
I went to Xichun Pavilion

128
00:06:06,100 --> 00:06:07,780
to investigate
the Imperial Retreat case,

129
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:09,480
not to seek pleasure.

130
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,160
Let me ask you this.

131
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,920
At Xichun Pavilion,

132
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:15,360
was there a girl named Hetao?

133
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,000
Please have some tea.

134
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,280
Just leave it there.

135
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,120
I haven't even served you tea,

136
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:26,640
yet your noble presence
already has me flustered.

137
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,040
Yes, there was.

138
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,440
Then is this girl

139
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:32,040
safe and well?

140
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:33,560
She's perfectly fine.

141
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,160
Mother,

142
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:36,840
why do you suddenly ask about her?

143
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,880
Come sit beside me.

144
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:48,040
My family
was very poor when I was young.

145
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,040
The only fertile field we owned

146
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:54,320
was seized by a local tyrant.

147
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,400
As a helpless young woman,

148
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,840
I had no other choice.

149
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:59,990
I could only enter
Xichun Pavilion of my own accord.

150
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,160
Later,

151
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:04,040
thanks to Hetao's help,

152
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,120
I

153
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:06,760
managed to escape from there.

154
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:11,000
But I was just a woman.

155
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:14,280
Even though I wasn't born
into the lowest social class,

156
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,480
I couldn't go into business,

157
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,600
much less take the imperial examination.

158
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:20,000
Later,

159
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:22,720
I finally managed
to escape to Bojue Kingdom.

160
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,120
I

161
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,040
disguised myself as a man

162
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,280
and set up a stall at the docks,

163
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:30,280
selling noodles and snacks.

164
00:07:30,300 --> 00:07:31,880
That was
how I barely managed to survive.

165
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:32,680
Then,

166
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,560
Mother, how did you

167
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:36,880
meet Father?

168
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:46,080
You take after your father.

169
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,920
When he was young,

170
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:50,290
he also liked sneaking
out of the palace in disguise

171
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:51,600
to see how the people lived.

172
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:53,440
Back then,

173
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,280
there was a gang of thugs at the docks

174
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,400
who kept coming

175
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,400
to demand money and cause trouble.

176
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:03,120
One time,
your father happened to be there.

177
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,760
I saw him trying to step in,

178
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:07,920
but they greatly outnumbered him.

179
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,200
Afraid he would get hurt,

180
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,960
I grabbed him by the ear

181
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,520
and said he was
the foolish helper at my stall.

182
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,760
I dragged him away by force.

183
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,320
But after I entered
the palace with your father,

184
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,560
things were different.

185
00:08:25,650 --> 00:08:27,390
There were
ancestral rules and traditions.

186
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:30,320
Even if your father didn't care,

187
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:33,760
there were still many eyes watching us.

188
00:08:35,220 --> 00:08:36,880
(The victor reigns,
and the loser falls.)

189
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,160
(I endured it all for the day)

190
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:41,520
(when I could stand
at the pinnacle of power.)

191
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:44,400
(Spirit Tablet of My Mother, Yanshu)
(Mother, this was your lifelong wish too, wasn't it?)

192
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,280
(The day I become ruler)

193
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:48,680
(will be the day our great
vengeance is finally fulfilled.)

194
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:51,160
I know your father

195
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:52,640
loves me deeply.

196
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:56,120
But with so many consorts
in the inner palace,

197
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:58,200
showing favoritism

198
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:00,280
will inevitably cause trouble.

199
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,760
The consorts' affections

200
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:06,160
are no different from those
of the girls at Xichun Pavilion.

201
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,360
Behind closed doors,

202
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:10,080
it's all schemes and calculations.

203
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:14,400
There's no one I can truly confide in.

204
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:16,760
Mother.

205
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,160
I've kept all this

206
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:23,480
bottled up for so many years.

207
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,160
Mother,

208
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,320
you've suffered so much.

209
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,520
For a while,

210
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,720
could you stay in the palace

211
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,240
and help me?

212
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:39,000
You've worked yourself so hard.

213
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:40,960
It pains me to see it.

214
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,760
Whatever I can do,

215
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,290
I will do everything in my power.

216
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,240
(Xiaobai,)

217
00:09:50,250 --> 00:09:52,040
(I need to remain
in the palace for the time being)

218
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:53,960
(to help Mother handle the memorials.)

219
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,370
(I won't be able
to see you for a while.)

220
00:09:55,380 --> 00:09:56,780
(There is much
to attend to in the palace.)

221
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:57,960
(Please don't worry about me.)

222
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,500
(As soon as I have some free time,)

223
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,640
(I'll come see you as soon as I can.)

224
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,240
Someone.

225
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,120
Yes.

226
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,590
Deliver this to
the Guaranteed Win Legal House for me.

227
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,660
Give it to Advocate Jiang.

228
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,520
Yes.

229
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:19,640
Your Highness.

230
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,120
What are you carrying?

231
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:26,480
The First Prince ordered me to go
to the Guaranteed Win Legal House

232
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:28,160
to deliver a letter to Advocate Jiang.

233
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:40,080
You may leave.

234
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:41,360
Yes.

235
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,160
Look at me.

236
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,880
What a beautiful night.

237
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:52,520
Talk to me.

238
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:54,600
You're ignoring me.

239
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,440
Miss Xiaobai,

240
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:58,120
someone just delivered a letter.

241
00:10:58,520 --> 00:10:59,360
Thank you.

242
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,390
(Reading this letter is
like seeing you in person.)

243
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:07,800
(When I think of our past affection)

244
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:09,120
(now,)

245
00:11:09,130 --> 00:11:10,760
(it all seems
like nothing but an illusion,)

246
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:11,990
(leaving only melancholy behind.)

247
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,040
(The affection we once shared)

248
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,640
(was merely a passing fancy,)

249
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,640
(not a love
that was ever meant to last.)

250
00:11:17,690 --> 00:11:19,120
(Upon reflecting on myself today,)

251
00:11:19,130 --> 00:11:20,790
(I finally realized
the one I truly love)

252
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:22,880
(is Rousang, who has been
by my side since childhood.)

253
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:24,080
(Rousang and I)

254
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:25,080
(grew up together,)

255
00:11:25,210 --> 00:11:26,700
(and our feelings took root long ago.)

256
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,200
(As the years passed,)

257
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,000
(our love only grew deeper.)

258
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,080
(I have now decided)

259
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,760
(to marry Rousang.)

260
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:33,680
(Before long,)

261
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:35,320
(we will hold our wedding.)

262
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,400
(You are exceptionally intelligent,)

263
00:11:37,410 --> 00:11:38,600
(so you should understand that love)

264
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:39,520
(cannot be forced.)

265
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:40,680
(Everything between us)

266
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,080
(should be left in the past.)

267
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:43,960
- (I hope you will not trouble me again.)
- Sizhou.

268
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,400
- (Whatever bond we shared)
- Sizhou.

269
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:46,600
(ends here.)

270
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:48,200
(From now on, we are strangers.)

271
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:49,720
- (We shall never meet again.)
- Sizhou.

272
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,730
Sizhou, come out!

273
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:51,920
Sizhou!

274
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,160
Sizhou!

275
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:09,280
Sizhou!

276
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,400
Sizhou!

277
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,200
Miss Xiaobai.

278
00:12:19,660 --> 00:12:22,260
♪The candle
burns down to its final glow♪

279
00:12:23,220 --> 00:12:25,620
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

280
00:12:26,260 --> 00:12:28,020
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

281
00:12:28,020 --> 00:12:30,940
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

282
00:12:33,380 --> 00:12:35,820
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

283
00:12:36,180 --> 00:12:39,500
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

284
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:41,660
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

285
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:45,140
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

286
00:12:47,900 --> 00:12:50,780
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

287
00:12:51,300 --> 00:12:54,380
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

288
00:12:54,820 --> 00:12:57,420
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

289
00:12:57,420 --> 00:13:01,460
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

290
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:04,740
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

291
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:07,820
♪And write
of every meeting and every parting♪

292
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:10,540
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

293
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:13,780
♪I'll only say that once♪

294
00:13:14,260 --> 00:13:16,020
♪I called your name♪

295
00:13:20,620 --> 00:13:22,860
♪The silent stars hang low♪

296
00:13:24,260 --> 00:13:26,460
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

297
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:29,620
♪I linger in the old tower♪

298
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:33,380
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

299
00:13:34,700 --> 00:13:37,140
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

300
00:13:38,020 --> 00:13:40,820
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

301
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:43,820
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

302
00:13:43,820 --> 00:13:50,060
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

303
00:13:50,340 --> 00:13:53,220
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

304
00:13:53,820 --> 00:13:57,300
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

305
00:13:57,300 --> 00:13:59,940
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

306
00:13:59,940 --> 00:14:04,220
♪Now only
fading warmth remains in my palm♪

307
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:07,140
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

308
00:14:07,580 --> 00:14:10,300
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

309
00:14:10,300 --> 00:14:12,980
♪If we meet again in another life♪

310
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:16,020
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

311
00:14:16,700 --> 00:14:18,980
♪Was when we first met?♪

312
00:14:20,260 --> 00:14:22,660
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

313
00:14:23,780 --> 00:14:25,540
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
